  "question": {
    "text": "A possible value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;for which the ninth term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msqrt><msup><mn>25</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math> in the increasing powers of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math> is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>180</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is :"
  },
