  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msqrt><msup><mn>25</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>25</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>Using the formula of the general term in the Binomial theorem for non negative integral index, i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>8</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(one of the possible value).</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
